// Per-construct DSL layout: every <kind>s.memql file in a domain holds
// every construct of that kind in the domain.

/// The log store's retention sweep (epic memql#4893, the authActivity
/// precedent): nightly at 03:20 UTC on the cron leader, archive every
/// expired day to blob storage, then delete it -- and never the second
/// without the first. The work is builtin logsSweep in component/logstore;
/// this automation only decides when it is asked. Retention is
/// MEMQL_LOGS_RETENTION_DAYS (default 30).
@trigger(schedule="0 20 3 * * *")
automation logsRetentionSweep {
  step sweep {
    builtin logsSweep ()
  }
}
